  ┌─ Keys · lazyrunner v<version> ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ Run                                                    z           Zoom the focused column             │
  │   Space       Start / stop the focused app             > <         Widen / narrow the focused column   │
  │   u U         Start · focused / all                    =           Equal column widths                 │
  │   s S         Stop · focused / all                     Ctrl+L      Clear output                        │
  │   r R         Restart · focused / all                  t           Theme picker (Default)              │
  │   b B         Rebuild · focused / all                Help                                              │
  │   q           Quit                                     ,           Settings (a u s e w toggles, r che… │
  │ Tools                                                  ?           Key reference                       │
  │   d           Switch database                          :           Command palette                     │
  │   i           npm ci (reinstall packages)            Navigate                                          │
  │   w W         Open in the browser · focused / all      h l Tab     focus another column                │
  │   o           Open the focused app's log file          1-5         jump to a column                    │
  │   y           Copy (yank)                              j k ↑ ↓     scroll a line                       │
  │   D           Durations                                ^u ^d ^b ^f half page / page (PgUp PgDn)        │
  │   x           Menu for the focused app                 gg G        oldest / follow new output          │
  │ View                                                   n N Esc     search: older / newer / clear       │
  │   /           Search the focused app's output                                                          │
  │ any key closes · : searches every command · lowercase = focused app, uppercase = all                   │
  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
